      ],
      "source": "https://www.vaco.org/county-connections/visit-stafford-county-and-the-stafford-county-historic-courthouse/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The courthouse complex sits on landscaped grounds in Stafford’s center, featuring a large porch with six white columns on its east front.",
