      "source": "https://www.vaco.org/county-connections/visit-stafford-county-and-the-stafford-county-historic-courthouse/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After the courthouse burned in 1715, a second was built that year at Stone Landing, and a third courthouse appeared in 1783 when the seat moved to Stafford.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
        29,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
